  "releaseNotes": "Fix: XsltTransformer.TransformAsync(XdmSequence) silently discarded non-node head items (typically maps/arrays produced by parse-json in a previous transform) and substituted a synthetic empty document, causing \"Lookup requires a map or array, got XdmDocument\" in the consumer stylesheet. Now mirrors TransformToSequenceAsync's non-node-head handling and threads the item through as the initial context. Martin Honnen 2026-05-23 JSON-chaining repro.\n      See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
